    "synopsis": {
        "native": "En 1949, Raymond Maufrais, un jeune explorateur fran\u00e7ais de 23 ans, part en exp\u00e9dition solitaire dans la for\u00eat amazonienne \u00e0 la recherche d\u2019un territoire encore inexplor\u00e9 peupl\u00e9 de tribus inconnues. Il dispara\u00eet en laissant derri\u00e8re lui un carnet de voyages qui retrace son parcours, ses rencontres et sa recherche de la Vie Pure. Son p\u00e8re le chercha pendant 12 ans, monta 22 exp\u00e9ditions et parcouru 12.000 km. Sa disparition reste aujourd\u2019hui encore inexpliqu\u00e9e\u2026",
        "english": "1949, Raymond Maufrais, a French explorer goes on a solitary expedition in the Amazon forest. He leaves behind him a diary that reflects the meaning of Pure Life and his encounters but he also leaves the mystery of his own disappearance..."
